00:07:46.299 --> 00:07:54.608 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est certain que de ce côté-

00:07:53.206 --> 00:07:55.475 size:53% position:73% line:53%
là, c'est des choses qui

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:58.945 size:53% position:73% line:53%
